{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Science or Science Fiction?"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Technological Innovations"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information about unlikely events or fairly certain conditions that will be fulfilled in present, past or future  in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le04ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Real Conditional: Expressing Truth Conditions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Real Conditional to talk about true conditions in the present or in the future."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If it is to be believed, they are a step closer to reality thanks to a new breakthrough in technology."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use both <span class=\"italic\">if </span>and <span class=\"italic\">when</span> in the Present Real Conditional. When you want to talk about true conditions, <span class=\"italic\">If </span>and <span class=\"italic\">When</span> have the same meaning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">If you want to keep powering your smartphone, pick up a glass and fabric-based thermoelectric generator.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Notice the structure of this type of conditional: <br> If / When ... Simple Present ..., ... Simple Present \u2026"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If this happens smaller, cheaper,easier to use devices are on their way!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If the new round of universal translators are any indication, they are ready to use yet. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you want a machine to recognize voices, it is much harder than originally thought, it seems."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Verbs Followed by -ing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about two actions linked together, you normally use two verbs. The first verb follows the rules of conjugation for the sentence, while the second verb can be a verb in the -ing form."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The researchers report finding they can be used to make better compact medical scanning gadgets. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use two verbs to talk about two connected actions. The main verb introduces the main action, and the second verb in the -ing form gives more information about that action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use a variety of verbs followed by a verb in the -ing form. Some of these verbs are related in meaning, or have opposite meanings, like: <br> <span class=\"italic\">like/dislike, start/stop, can't bear/stand, love/adore/hate, allow/forbid, admit/deny, quit/finish, appreciate/resent ...</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Other verbs followed by verbs in -ing are prepositional verbs like <span class=\"italic\">end up, carry on, keep on, go on, \u2026</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure: <br> Subject + first verb + -ing form of the second verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at some examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Try using a device that is not word perfect. Start a conversation by insulting the person you are speaking to."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you employ the machine at this time, that is exactly what it ends up doing."}, {"type": "example", "content": "So innovations are coming, some faster than others. Scientists never think about giving up. They are always interested in moving forward."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to power"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to provide something with the energy it needs to operate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If this technology works you can one day power your smartphone by using just body heat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about technology in the future."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "generator "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a machine which produces electricity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you want to keep powering your smartphone, pick up a glass and fabric-based thermoelectric generator. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to employ"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you employ the machine at this time, that is exactly what it ends up doing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to convert"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bchange the \u200bcharacter, \u200bappearance, or \u200boperation of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Forget using a clumsy charger, the thermoelectric generator can convert heat, or a temperature difference, into electric energy!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "surrounding "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "all around a particular place or thing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will produce around 40 milliwatts of electric power based on the temperature difference of 0.5\u00b0C (31\u00b0F) between human skin and the surrounding air if you have it on."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scanner "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a machine which reads information and puts it into a computer system"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember watching people use those hand held medical scanners on Star Trek? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "indication "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a sign that something exists, is true, or likely to happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If the new round of universal translators are any indication, they are ready to use yet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le04ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the 1960s Star Trek was an innovative new future series, where many new technological items were used."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do some reading (or listening) to find out how many of these technologies have actually come to be. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a brief summary of 5 items, tying it to what we use or will soon be using."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your summaries to a partner or group and discuss them."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read about or listen to descriptions of items now or soon in use previewed on Star Trek."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a brief summary of 5 items."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the real conditional."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I tie the items to wha